-- =====================================================================
-- FYNDO: 177 real places in Colombo 3, 4, 5, 7, Dehiwala and Mount Lavinia, from Google Places (official API).
-- Each is linked to its Google listing (google_place_id), so photos, rating, hours and reviews load live from Google.
-- Price ranges come from Google's price level (rough LKR per person). None are marked Verified: check them as you visit.
-- How to use: Supabase > SQL Editor > New query > paste this whole file > Run. Safe to run again.
-- Remove the made-up sample places afterwards:  delete from public.spots where name like '%(Sample)%';
-- =====================================================================
on conflict (id) do nothing;
